    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1016-a1">

                <pb facs="1061" n="775" xml:id="pg775"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Affidavit of the master of the “Stephano”</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-11">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 11, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>At 6 p. m. sighted submarine; at 6.05 submarine fired shot which struck us under
                    forefoot port side, twisting stem. I having received no warning from submarine,
                    verbal or signaling, she then fired three more which landed fifty to one hundred
                    yards ahead of ship.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">C. Smith</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Master S. S. Stephano</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Witness to above signature: <lb/>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Arthur T. Blackwood</hi>
                        
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Commander R. N.</hi>
                    </p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
